    "review_run_sha256": "51de654d6ad6657df23c0f867c98927d07589c8eca1196f84130cda115abd644",
    "evidence": "Fresh anti-anchored review began only with work-refactored.source-review.json. No old verdict, audit, review output or proposed overlay was consulted in reaching this decision. The unchanged statement/reconstruction evidence in this packet was checked independently against the current statement and interpreter meaning. Packet canonical sha256 33974feceae46ddd5cb3dc20b8276cbee647ce8193469cfafc2955cb106dae35 and raw sha256 78ddac154235baa365fc1e7739c4275b4a2ec2ac70ac5dd220a32f6aa0012404 were recomputed. Source, Lean-statement and reconstruction text hashes match. Checked base HEAD 6410634a18e787d1e8d09e02a75a28c623398967 and the exact current whole RealizedProximalWork module text, including both imports and all scoped variables. Publication file digest is normalized-text sha256 b00dd8c972fea2ff7f1dc7af73615854068fb1744082940ef2bb0742a717e6eb, matching the packet; raw Windows checkout bytes sha256 5a66936c34192a7e31f1134108834258cdbe09623a5f6b173523c19672a90656 differ only by CRLF. The extracted ProximalExecutionIdentity module was read in full: raw sha256 f56481c1f0c3dd58345b88c5f9fd1008dd838728b5d1ff9138dd5c65be2dea4e and LF/text sha256 9aaa4663ed6fe53fad28369f1249a1e5bdd5e63b971868a63266dc1c1a8129f7. The complete Jensen parent ProximalExpectedWork was read: raw sha256 67d735f1adae0cd37b7f061d49aa8e7be6efd9faf28f733c860b706c6154cb99 and LF/text sha256 eb831028f663392ce8412f4d7f01ecf63f41582492c62df0751501de5fa1a44a. The live primary source https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06906v1 Algorithm D.2/D.3 and D.4 Jensen lines 2138-2186 was inspected. The imported identity induction is mathematically complete: success rules out zero fuel; the common residual branch either returns the same current point/count one or recurses from the identical next iterate; recursive equality propagates after both counts are incremented. It adds no smoothness, contraction, measurability, integrability or cost premise. Applying it to the supplied run and the canonical successful parent run proves equality of returned pairs and then exact N=M. The realized-work child forms nu=mu.map Y, transports the supplied moment under this exact law, obtains the existing successful measurable parent count and its Jensen bound, identifies the supplied count, and pulls both integrals back. Count measurability/integrability is derived, not supplied. The complete parent proof justifies logarithm integrability and the concave-log/L2 inequalities with the displayed coefficient. There is no cost-from-TV, proxy input law or silent moment estimate. All current authored proof steps, formulae and actual ASTIS dependencies were checked against the changed module and extracted dependency. They point to ProximalExecutionIdentity.successful_query_unique and preserve the remaining D.7/D.8 boundaries. Fresh LEAN_NUM_THREADS=2 lake env lean Tests/SmoothedPicardHMCRealizedProximalWork.lean exited 0 and printed only propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound. Focused fake-closure scan of the child, extracted identity and Jensen parent found no sorry, admit, axiom, Prop:=True or :=trivial. No blocking mathematical, source or exposition gap is found for this explicitly conditional component; this review makes no D.7, D.8, quadrature or main-theorem completion claim.",
